      ],
      "text": "L2MAC is described as an LLM-based multi-agent system implementing a stored-program von Neumann-style architecture for extensive, consistent output generation."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6e34f0918824d10bbc18e4c655bb9a8208177c37650d5d8786fc358697c5f903",
