          "git_sha": "2811b5399a040d0b2a89bf69abf7bea69a395e93",
          "line_end": 29,
          "line_start": 28,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "samholt/l2mac",
          "url": "https://github.com/samholt/L2MAC/blob/105e74afdc6721e4d530c65862a32b97b5434e61/README.md#L28-L29"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_449ed80cc86a3dd6a1dbb8d193dc86ebc5e8d6e659feddca47b017f53e024914"
      ],
      "text": "Each prompt-program instruction step is loaded into a new LLM agent whose context is managed by a control unit and given tools to read and write a persistent file-store holding final and intermediate outputs."
    },
