        "slc_449ed80cc86a3dd6a1dbb8d193dc86ebc5e8d6e659feddca47b017f53e024914"
      ],
      "text": "The prompt-program is a sequence of instruction-step prompts; unless explicitly given, it is self-generated (bootstrapped) and then executed."
    },
