  "summary": "L2MAC is documented as an LLM-based multi-agent framework that executes self-generated prompt programs via a control unit and persistent file store to produce large outputs (codebases, books) from a single prompt, with a CLI and Python API, YAML-based LLM configuration, and reported benchmark results.",
